---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Career Hound"
  description="Career Hound Terms of Service. Understand subscription policies, Dodo Payments billing terms, and direct application guidelines."
>
  <div class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 prose prose-slate">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-2">Terms and Conditions</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-8">Last updated: September 19, 2026</p>

      <section class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By creating an account, accessing verified listings, utilizing our growth tools, or purchasing a subscription pass on Career Hound, you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>
          Career Hound provides direct-to-company job discovery, aggregating verified career listings from Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby, Workday, and other ATS systems without middleman recruiters. We also offer AI-powered resume enhancement, saved job bookmarking, and direct company application links.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">3. Billing & Payments (Dodo Payments)</h2>
        <p>
          All subscription plans (Weekly Job Hunt Pass, Monthly Unlimited, 1-Year Annual Pass) are billed through our Merchant of Record, <strong>Dodo Payments Inc.</strong>:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Recurring Billing:</strong> Weekly and monthly subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled before the renewal date via the customer billing portal.</li>
          <li><strong>Taxes:</strong> Dodo Payments automatically calculates and remits applicable sales tax, GST, or VAT based on your jurisdiction.</li>
          <li><strong>Refund Policy:</strong> We offer a 7-day money-back guarantee if you are unsatisfied with the quality of direct job feeds or search tools.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">4. Direct ATS Application & Search Guidelines</h2>
        <p>
          Career Hound provides direct, verified links to employer career and ATS application portals:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>You warrant that all information, experience, work history, and contact details provided in your profile and submitted to employers are accurate and truthful.</li>
          <li>Career Hound does not guarantee employment or interview offers, as hiring decisions rest exclusively with the prospective employers.</li>
          <li>You apply directly on employers' official portals in accordance with each employer's specific hiring procedures.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          Career Hound is not responsible for changes made by external companies to their job postings, ATS form structure, or third-party hiring decisions. In no event shall Career Hound or Dodo Payments be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
